==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|minus|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-moins.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/mwɛ̃/|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|[mwæ̃]|lang=fr}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[less]]
#: ''Faites '''moins''' de bruit.'' — “Make less noise.”
#: ''J'ai '''moins''' de thé que toi.'' — "I have '''less''' tea than you."
#: ''J'ai '''moins''' de thé que de café.'' — "I have '''less''' tea than coffee."
#: ''J'ai dû attendre '''moins''' de dix minutes.'' — "I had to wait '''less''' than ten minutes."
# {{context|with numbers|lang=fr}} [[minus]]; [[negative]]
#: '''''moins''' cinq'' — “minus five”
# {{context|preceded by a [[definite article]]|lang=fr}} the [[least]]
#: ''C'est lui qui gagne le '''moins''' (d'argent) dans sa famille.'' — “He earns the least money in his family.”
#: ''C'était la chose la '''moins''' surprenante.'' — “It was the least surprising thing.”

====Antonyms====
* [[plus#French|plus]]

====Derived terms====
* [[à moins que]]
* [[au moins]]

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m|moins}}

# the [[minus]] sign

===Preposition===
{{fr-prep}}

# [[minus]]
#: ''Cinq '''moins''' deux font trois'' — “Five minus two makes three.”

